    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical realm, a princess has been imprisoned in a distant time and space by invaders. Her allies, in a desperate bid to save her, inadvertently summon you to this parallel universe. You must quickly learn the ways of this new world, assist in safeguarding the summoning ceremony, repel the disruptions caused by alien species, and ultimately bring back the true princess to reinstate peace and order. Yet, the path ahead is fraught with unexpected challenges...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/81db26458182319ea5956ac0012e6111.avif?t=1741708630\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful girls + Tower defense game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eastern fantasy art style</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your war spirits across the battlefield to shield the summoner from relentless enemy assaults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battlefield introduces distinct environmental factors and enemy types. Carefully choose your war spirits to match the terrain and adapt your defensive tactics on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character can switch costumes to unlock various powers, enabling direct influence over the unfolding events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical realm, a princess has been imprisoned in a distant time and space by invaders. Her allies, in a desperate bid to save her, inadvertently summon you to this parallel universe. You must quickly learn the ways of this new world, assist in safeguarding the summoning ceremony, repel the disruptions caused by alien species, and ultimately bring back the true princess to reinstate peace and order. Yet, the path ahead is fraught with unexpected challenges...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/81db26458182319ea5956ac0012e6111.avif?t=1741708630\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful girls + Tower defense game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eastern fantasy art style</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your war spirits across the battlefield to shield the summoner from relentless enemy assaults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/662ebea2e1d18b317b78260267196a83.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battlefield introduces distinct environmental factors and enemy types. Carefully choose your war spirits to match the terrain and adapt your defensive tactics on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/8195908f7b1b7a5f722abc5e32709a50.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character can switch costumes to unlock various powers, enabling direct influence over the unfolding events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.poster.avif?t=1741708630\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.webm?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561570/extras/eaf1c3eef4247f13fcb71ffd61b3c18c.mp4?t=1741708630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
